<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:40:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>日本人寿保险公司对冲创历史新低，使日元走势复杂化</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging</link><description>日本最大的人寿保险公司在上半财年将货币对冲削减至历史新低后，日本齐心协力提振日元的努力遇到了重大阻力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging'&gt;日本人寿保险公司对冲创历史新低，使日元走势复杂化&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Life Insurers Complicate Yen Fight With Record Low Hedging&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/japan-life-insurers-complicate-yen-fight-with-record-low-hedging</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:36:45 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>阿达尼公司计划公开发行债券筹集至少 2.2 亿美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/adani-firms-plan-public-bond-sale-to-raise-at-least-220-million</link><description>据知情人士透露，印度亿万富翁高塔姆·阿达尼 (Gautam Adani) 控制的两家公司正在寻求出售公共债券，以筹集至少 200 亿卢比（2.2 亿美元），这将提振印度低迷的国内公共债务市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/adani-firms-plan-public-bond-sale-to-raise-at-least-220-million'&gt;阿达尼公司计划公开发行债券筹集至少 2.2 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Adani Firms Plan Public Bond Sale to Raise at Least $220 Million&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/adani-firms-plan-public-bond-sale-to-raise-at-least-220-million</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:42:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</link><description>迪拜伊斯兰银行 PJSC 表示，它将收购阿联酋伊斯兰银行 PJSC，该交易将创建世界上最大的上市伊斯兰银行集团之一，资产约为 1,590 亿美元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant'&gt;迪拜银行合并将打造 1,590 亿美元的伊斯兰贷款巨头&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Seals Deal to Form $159 Billion Islamic Banking Giant&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/dubai-bank-merger-to-create-159-billion-islamic-lending-giant</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 15:48:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</link><description>巴基斯坦证券交易所计划明年推出股票期权，为投资者提供另一种工具，让他们押注过去三年增长了两倍的市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options'&gt;中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China-Backed Pakistan Exchange Prepares to Launch Stock Options&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:00:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks, Nasdaq Futures Climb as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>